WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.310
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.440
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.030
Shining Finger

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.740
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:48.440
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.240
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.080
Bright you now

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Shining Finger

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:25.220
Let's see...

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:27.310
Over the past 60 years...

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:30.650
...ever since people went up
to the Space Colonies...

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:34.030
...even Kyoto has been
reduced to this state.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:38.400
Even so, it would be rude of me
not to serve you some tea.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:43.200
But why would you consider
meeting at this rundown temple?

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:48.120
It looks like I got here
a bit too early.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.210
Not at all.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:53.710
I failed to mention that
Rain will not be coming.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.960
What?!

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.850
Wh-who are you...?

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.650
Now, everybody...

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:19.400
...today we will finally start to
unravel the mystery of this photo.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:22.070
Just who is the person
in the picture?

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:25.870
And why exactly has Domon
Kasshu been pursuing this man?

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:29.410
These questions shall be answered
by the Devil Gundam...

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:33.380
...today's opponent, and the
strongest Gundam of them all.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.500
And now!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:39.380
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:45.720
Fight, Domon! Earth is the Ring!

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:44.110
Fight, Domon! Earth is the Ring!

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.530
Platoons 1 and 2,
cover areas A to F!

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.280
Platoons 3 to 5,
cover areas G to L!

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:04.410
Listen, our only chance is to hit
him when he makes his appearance!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.080
Don't waste the opportunity!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.620
Fire!

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.340
We did it!

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:44.320
Th-this can't be!

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.080
D-Devil Gundam!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.130
Has it been a year
since that incident?

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.340
Yes.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.510
The area has recently been restored.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.590
There're no traces left.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.550
Clearly, we cannot afford to have...

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.270
...any of the other Colony Nations
find out about that incident.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:16.190
However, we cannot have
anyone exploit the Gundam Fight.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:19.520
Forgive me, Commissioner Karato.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:23.860
You may observe for yourself.
Domon should awaken at anytime.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.240
Yes.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.200
The simulated event takes place...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:31.020
...the day he returned from
his long martial arts training.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.170
Domon... Domon...

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.730
Domon...

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:42.130
Wake up.
How long are you going to sleep?

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:56.890
K-Kyoji!

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.940
Kyoji, it's you!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.610
Kyoji!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.570
You look a lot tougher.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:06.990
It's been a really, really long time!

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.280
Welcome home.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.790
Dad! Mom!

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.750
Have you been eating well?

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:21.040
I've made it back home,
Dad. Mom...

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.350
Is this really worth it, Ulube?

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.810
What are you getting at?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:40.980
Listen.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.820
I just don't think that it's worth
the risk...

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:48.200
...of disregarding Gundam Fight
International Regulations...

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:51.490
...by bringing a fighter back to the
Colony while the Fight is in progress.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.910
I understand your concern.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:54.990
However...

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:59.080
I believe I can demonstrate that
Domon Kasshu is the best man...

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:02.210
...to resolve this crisis we're facing.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.470
It's been a long while, Domon.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.390
Rain?

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.390
You forgot her already?

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:16.060
You two used to hang around
together all the time.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:22.360
You're surprised to see how grown
up and gorgeous she is, right?

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.110
Come on...

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:34.430
You were away from home
a full ten years.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:39.910
But I trained very hard, and I even
earned the title King of Hearts!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:41.830
I see...

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.250
My kid brother is now the
Colony champion of martial arts.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.760
What was his name again?
Your teacher?

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.510
Master Asia!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.470
He sure was strong!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:57.220
He was top ranked in the Shuffle
Alliance of the five masters.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.310
He's known as the
"Undefeated of the East"...

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.810
...and the former King of Hearts!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.400
But after he gave me this crest...

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.400
...he just disappeared.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.240
In any case, Domon...

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.570
...Dad and I completed the project.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.040
You mean THE project?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.330
If you'd like,
I'll show it to you later.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.500
Make it some other time, Dear.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.210
We're supposed to be celebrating
Domon's return from his training.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.710
So let's not talk about work.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.010
Otherwise, we'll end up
talking about it all night.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.930
Thank you, Mom.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:39.140
Delicious!
Mom's cooking is truly the best!

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:42.890
Then, why not stay home for good?

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.810
I'd be so lonely without you
if you were to leave again.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.320
Don't worry.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.360
I'm not going to go anywhere.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:53.780
I'm happiest when I'm with you
and the rest of my family, Mom!

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:55.950
Yeah, but I bet you were...

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.330
...homesick for Mom
the whole time, right?

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.200
Come on, Kyoji,
I'm not a kid anymore.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:03.750
Really? But, to me, you're still a kid.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.330
You're right about that.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:09.340
This is horrible.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.800
This is just too horrible!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.140
The psychological tests using
hallucinations are fine and all...

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.480
...but what good will this do?

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.190
Well, there's no need to worry.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:31.940
The Devil Gundam will appear
again, just like on that day.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.030
Rain!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.460
Why did you leave so suddenly?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.000
Father!
I can't take this anymore!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.840
This experiment is too cruel
for Domon!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:55.010
I feel bad about it myself.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.850
But we just have to keep looking
at this as an unusual punishment.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.220
But why?!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.100
Domon has done nothing wrong!

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:03.520
Listen...

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.520
We must have Domon
continue to fight...

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:10.360
...in the Gundam Fight no matter
what risks he must take.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.860
You see, Commissioner Karato...

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:17.360
...isn't concerned about the terrible
dangers potentially facing Earth.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.240
The only thing on his mind...

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:23.040
...is winning and becoming
Prime Minister of Neo Japan.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.200
Rain.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.330
The next stage of this test
is important.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:30.920
However, I'm concerned about
the actions taken by Karato.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.170
Understand?

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:43.850
You like it?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.390
Kyoji and I worked together
to build this Gundam.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:51.100
The future of humankind rests on
the shoulders of this Gundam.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.940
The future of humankind?

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:56.540
That's right.
The future of humankind.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.910
With this one Gundam...

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.870
...the possibilities are endless.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:04.170
Anything is possible.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:06.830
Kyoji?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.920
What do you mean by that?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.090
No, it's not that important.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.550
What's this? What's going on?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.840
Darling!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.640
Dr. Kasshu.
And your son, Kyoji Kasshu.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:29.560
You both are hereby under arrest
for suspicion of treason.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.400
What do you mean?!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.400
Hold on!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.900
What is the meaning of this?!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:38.820
We believe you are planning to
use that Gundam as a weapon...

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:42.440
...and to destroy the United
Colonies Federation and Earth...

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:44.620
...with total domination
as your objective.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.630
That's ridiculous!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:47.830
Kyoji?

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:53.040
That was a fast response...

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.040
...comrades of the military police.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:10:59.470
Domon...

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.220
Everything that man is saying
is true.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.220
What?! You can't be serious!

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.220
Sorry about that, Dad.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:10.640
But now I'm free to do anything
I want with this Gundam.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.980
Like this.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:23.360
Kyoji!

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:24.870
Fire.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:33.290
Kyoji!

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:35.170
Kyoji!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.090
Stop this, please!
Please!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.770
Kyoji, this is a misunderstanding.
Right?

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:43.970
Look out, Mom!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.430
Kyoji!

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.390
Mom!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:00.690
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:02.820
Mom!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:04.820
No!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.410
M-Mom...!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:16.500
Kyoji!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.340
Our mother!
Our own mother!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:22.470
Our mom...

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:35.850
M-Mom...

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:42.240
It's true that this illusion was
created based on our records.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.320
He was actually not present
when this happened.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:49.620
However, Domon did go there
immediately afterwards.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.040
I'm sorry.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.970
I feel terrible about this.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:56.250
As a personal friend of your dad,
I feel I could've done something.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.330
The Neo Japan Government...

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:01.340
...has ruled that your father
was an accomplice...

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.840
...and sentenced him to indefinite
suspension in cryogenic state.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.470
How could they?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.470
We did everything possible.

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.780
But the best we could do was
avoid capital punishment.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.930
As for what happened
to the Devil Gundam...

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.570
It slipped into Earth's atmosphere...

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:24.150
...undetected as if it was nothing.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.990
We figured he couldn't
have survived...

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.660
...at that re-entry speed.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.160
In our minds, the case was closed.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.330
However, it was only the beginning.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.750
We realized something astonishing
in our subsequent investigation.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:43.960
Yes. Even if the Gundam
had been destroyed upon re-entry...

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.790
...it possesses three
amazing abilities.

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:51.180
The ability to self-multiply,
self-recover and self-evolve.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.350
Therefore, it will resurrect itself...

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:56.230
...and Kyoji Kasshu will no doubt
use those abilities...

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.100
...and destroy everything in sight.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:03.070
Also, as long as Neo Hong Kong
rules over Earth...

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.400
...we must be very careful.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.030
Therefore...

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.860
...we would like you to
become a Gundam Fighter!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:10.990
What?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:12.330
Listen...

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.240
...according to my calculations...

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:17.710
...it'll take one year before he
completely recovers on Earth.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.440
That year just happens
to coincide with...

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:23.130
...a quadrennial event,
the Gundam Fight.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.420
During the tournament...

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:27.260
...you'll be able to move
freely about the Earth.

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.050
You will be able to pursue him...

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.680
...and then capture him.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:33.140
Otherwise, nothing will change.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.260
Domon...

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.730
The only one capable
of capturing him...

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.350
...is you, the King of Hearts.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.520
Father.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.650
I'll get him...

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:49.780
Kyoji...

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.030
Kyoji...

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:54.330
Commissioner Karato!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.660
I've seen all I want.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.200
What does this prove, anyway?

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:01.120
Don't you see?
His strong willpower is necessary.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.540
It will guarantee his winning
the championship as well.

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:06.500
What about his poor record?

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.010
Neo America
Gundam Maxter

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.500
Gundam Maxter...

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.470
Neo China
Dragon Gundam

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:09.470
Dragon Gundam...

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.930
Neo France
Gundam Rose

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:10.930
Gundam Rose...

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.390
Neo Russia
Bolt Gundam

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.390
Bolt Gundam...

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:16.100
He could've beaten some of these
opponents, but chose not to.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:21.100
He probably realized they had no
connection with his brother Kyoji.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.190
Moreover...

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.490
...we instructed Domon
to fight particular opponents...

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:29.030
...because we wanted him to
hit the countries most likely...

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.610
...to be aware of the incident
involving Devil Gundam.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:34.280
But we didn't expect these results.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.370
I'll at least acknowledge that.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.330
Then, I want to run this test
my way to get the results I want.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:41.160
What?

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:42.620
What do you mean?

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.340
This is...!

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.090
What are you trying to do?!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.220
Simple.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.980
I'm seeing whether or not
he has the guts...

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:04.270
...to defeat his brother
if he were to face him.

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:07.190
Whether or not he can strike
down his brother as an enemy.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.650
That's what I want to test.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.070
Of course,
this will be an actual battle.

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:17.280
Domon Kasshu will pilot
the real Shining Gundam.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.540
And his opponent will be
the mobile armor, Fantoma...

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.080
However...

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.750
...the illusion will make his enemy
appear to him as the Devil Gundam.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.670
Is it too exciting for just an experiment?

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.100
But don't worry.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.770
Should anything happen to Domon...

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.310
...I will use my position
and persuade...

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:47.560
...the International Committee
to approve an alternate Fighter.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.950
All right...

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:02.080
Let's see if he has the guts
to fight his brother.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.120
Oh, I forgot!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.620
When you faced the Devil Gundam...

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.330
...you could do nothing but tremble...

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.120
...and were wiped out along with
Fantoma...

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:13.010
...and that's when you got that
scar under your mask, right?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.050
Oh, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.600
I suspected he'd come up
with something like this.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.190
I-it's you, Kyoji...!

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:34.940
Sorry, but I thought
you could use a nap.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.080
You have to stop this, Kyoji!

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.290
Domon! It's not too late!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.500
Get out of your Shining Gundam!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.010
Kyoji...

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.050
You plan to shoot your own brother?

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.670
Kyoji!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.110
Now! Finish him off for me!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.160
I made it in time.
But...

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.420
Th-that's...

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:42.100
Rescue team, hurry up
and get my daughter.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.100
How utterly pathetic.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.980
No. Look more carefully, sir.

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.020
What?

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:53.440
Domon...?

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:04.410
Th-that Gundam is shining!

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.160
What's happening?!

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:25.890
Brother!

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:28.020
No, Kyoji!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.480
I will never forgive you!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.940
You've taken away our mother
and shamed our father!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:36.780
You will never be forgiven!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:50.870
Super Mode
Shining Gundam

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:54.460
What's that?

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.670
Take a look.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.960
That is the true form
of our Shining Gundam.

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:02.800
That's its true form?!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.260
Correct.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:07.510
When his extreme anger peaks...

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.600
...his emotions become energy...

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.140
...enabling a maximum power...

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:13.480
...resulting from that transformation.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:14.690
In other words...

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:18.480
...the only one who can unleash the
power of our Shining Gundam...

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:22.950
...is Domon Kasshu, the man who
has vowed revenge on his brother!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.280
My hand glows with
an awesome power!

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.410
It cries out to me to defeat you!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.040
Take this!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.290
My love, my anger,
and all of my sorrow!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:39.550
Shining Finger Sword!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:43.420
Go! Go! Go!

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.180
Karato!

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:55.940
Listen! Never play tricks like this
on me again!

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:58.900
Domon! When did you realize
this wasn't real?!

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:00.190
Listen up!

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.190
From now on, don't interfere!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:06.570
I will find Kyoji and defeat the
Devil Gundam!

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.530
With my own hands!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:17.330
Just do as you wish!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:20.290
Rain!

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.320
We'll be returning to Earth.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.170
Or rather, to our battleground!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:26.680
Right!

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:34.910
Father...

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.330
That was a close call.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.200
However...

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.160
...no matter what obstacles
we face...

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:56.790
...we cannot dismiss
the Devil Gundam.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:57.960
To do this...

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:01.420
...we're putting your daughter
through a great deal of sorrow.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.760
Nevertheless...

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.720
...we have only one objective.

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:07.680
Yes.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:10.220
Until then...

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.640
...they must be the lonely fighters...

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:15.350
...that can keep moving
no matter how difficult it is.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:33.080
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:37.460
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.460
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:58.350
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:03.610
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:10.150
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:14.280
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:20.290
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:35.390
Everyone! It's the moment
you've been waiting for.

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:37.640
Domon's life is threatened by a man...

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:40.390
...while he is in sunny Neo Mexico.

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:43.270
The man's name is
Chico Rodriguez.

00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:45.860
To quit as a Gundam Fighter...

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.400
...Chico targets government officials,
as well as Chibodee Crocket.

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:53.070
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:56.250
Prepare to Fight!
Desperate Fugitive.

00:23:54.070 --> 00:24:00.990
Prepare to Fight!
Desperate Fugitive
